                    "text": "@RepJimBaird @SecKennedy @SecRollins @GovBraun @SarahHuckabee I remember when Michelle Obama tried to get everyone to eat healthy and some Republicans lost their minds.\nA few questions\u2026\nDid Sarah lose weight by eating healthy or taking a weight loss drug?\nIs healthy food more expensive?\nAre you increasing SNAP funds?",
